#====================================================================
# DRAFT-dwarves-ohos-cmake-soname-flag.kv
# OHOS 无 CMake 平台模块 -> CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG 未定义
# -> SOVERSION 不产出 DT_SONAME; 需显式注入 -Wl,-soname, flag
# 完整叙事与证据见同目录 .md
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT (proposed E-numbered, 最终编号由知识库主编确认)
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|ohc_w3
phase:                  packaging|build
error_signature:        .*\.so 缺少 DT_SONAME|DT_SONAME.*not found|SOVERSION.*soname|System is unknown to cmake.*Platform/HarmonyOS
severity:               2
category:               conan, cmake, linking, ohos, packaging
match_keywords:         SONAME, DT_SONAME, SOVERSION, cmake, OHOS, HarmonyOS, platform module, soname flag, shared library, symlink, libdwarves, W3, L5a, CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG
title:                  OHOS 无 CMake 平台模块导致 CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG 未定义, SOVERSION 不产出 DT_SONAME(无版本化符号链接), W3 L5a 报缺少 DT_SONAME; 配方 generate() 显式注入 -Wl,-soname, 修复
root_cause:             OHOS 无 CMake 平台模块(configure 报 System is unknown to cmake, create: Platform/HarmonyOS), CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG 未定义(Linux 上为 -Wl,-soname,). 上游 CMakeLists 虽设 PROPERTIES VERSION x.y SOVERSION n, 但链接命令缺 soname flag, 产出无 DT_SONAME 的 .so 且无版本化符号链接, 下游链接器无法按 SONAME 寻址. 与打包期问题(E274 缺 symlink / E316 缺实体)不同, 本候选为构建期 flag 未注入
affected_scope:         任何在 OHOS(或缺 CMake 平台模块系统)上用 CMake SOVERSION 构建共享库的 Conan 2 library 配方; W3 L5a 门禁检查 DT_SONAME
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/d/dwarves/1.30 -pr:h=<repo>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=<repo>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing --user=ohpcd --channel=stable; 修复前 llvm-readelf -d libdwarves.so 无 SONAME 且包内无 .so.1 链接, W3 L5a fail; 修复后包内出现 libdwarves.so.1/.so.1.0.0, readelf 显示 (SONAME) [libdwarves.so.1], W3 L5a pass
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           cmake-toolchain-soname-flag-injection
rec_description:        配方 generate() 中 CMakeToolchain 变量显式补 CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG="-Wl,-soname,", 使 SOVERSION 属性真正产出 DT_SONAME 与版本化符号链接; 无需改上游 CMakeLists
rec_command:            tc = CMakeToolchain(self)\ntc.variables["CMAKE_SHARED_LIBRARY_SONAME_C_FLAG"] = "-Wl,-soname,"\ntc.generate()
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe
forbid_1_pattern:       strip.*SONAME|mv lib.*\.so
forbid_1_reason:        手工改名/去 SONAME 破坏链接寻址语义